            "5",
            "0"
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "explanation": "The subroutine doubles A."
        },
        {
          "id": "al13-l1-e6",
          "type": "multiple_choice",
          "prompt": "Why do subroutines come after HLT?",
          "options": [
